---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Main title="Sovereign AI for Government & Dual-Use - Aurora Nyxus" description="CLOUD-Act-free, Canadian-custody AI infrastructure for the public sector and dual-use programs.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Government"
    title="Canadian compute, free of foreign reach"
    lede="Canadian-owned, physically in-country, free of CLOUD Act exposure. Verifiable security posture with DAI Compute."
    accent="violet"
    bgSrc="/images/hardware/hero-bg-mesh.webp"
    bgAlt="Meshed nodes for sovereign government deployments"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">The sovereignty case</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Canadian programs routinely run through US-owned infrastructure.
          Under the US CLOUD Act, that data is reachable, even on Canadian
          soil. We deploy owned, in-country compute so sovereignty is
          structural, not contractual.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">Dual-use aligned</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Sovereign compute fits dual-use funding. We build to a verifiable,
          auditable standard and partner with DAI Compute for financing and
          sovereignty framing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-px border border-hairline bg-hairline sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-green">01</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">CLOUD-Act-free</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Canadian-owned, in-country hardware.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-signal">02</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Auditable</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Documented security posture and verifiable custody.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-violet">03</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Financed</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Infrastructure-finance backing via DAI Compute.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-8 sm:pb-32">
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-block rounded-sm border border-aurora-violet/50 bg-aurora-violet/10 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-aurora-violet transition-colors hover:bg-aurora-violet/20">Discuss a sovereign deployment</a>
  </section>
</Main>
